openapi.json is the official Screeps World HTTP contract of
https://github.com/openscreeps/openapi, copied byte for byte from:

  commit 1cf3725ab8df0b61028ae3177750217430abb818
  path   openapi.json
  blob   784aa003218a00d62b14f6bf46b8d375f6aabacb

It is licensed under the ISC License in LICENSE (copied from the same
commit, blob 021d06101034112c437098f09f6db141d345d406).

The tests of src/api/contract.rs check every request of the API client
against it.
To move to another commit of a checkout of openscreeps/openapi:

  git -C OPENAPI show COMMIT:openapi.json > contract/openapi.json
  git -C OPENAPI show COMMIT:LICENSE > contract/LICENSE
  git hash-object contract/openapi.json contract/LICENSE

and update the commit and the blobs here and in src/api/contract.rs.
